{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8...eb1a0d11a96767a715a136ee43d94097ddf5b9cd","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8...eb1a0d11a96767a715a136ee43d94097ddf5b9cd","permalink_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/kevinrhaas:fa115d7...kevinrhaas:eb1a0d1","diff_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8...eb1a0d11a96767a715a136ee43d94097ddf5b9cd.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8...eb1a0d11a96767a715a136ee43d94097ddf5b9cd.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8","node_id":"C_kwDOUoK9jtoAKGZhMTE1ZDcyNTM0ZTIzNGZlNWFjN2I5NGZkMmYxYTNlYjM4MDY1Yzg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Kevin Haas","email":"kevinroberthaas@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-23T19:01:10Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-23T19:01:10Z"},"message":"T-2800, T-2803: add a planted standing horse to the Western Hotel yard (#1244)\n\n* T-2800: add a planted standing horse to the Western Hotel yard\n\nAdd the licensed canonical-metre horse and reconstructed 26-joint planted body shift, actual drawn-yard support, selection/card and owned material/mixer lifetime. Preserve existing people, vehicles and UI. Keep photographic, walking, harness, occupied and riding acceptance open.\n\nExclude unrelated recovery archives from the existing ticket-mirror fixture, retaining all ticket inputs and original mirror assertions; clean up a failed initial copy. Isolate default-CPU fixtures from caller limits and take the real mid-lap lock in the rebuild process, with an independent live-marker assertion. Emit fixture API states in Bash and preserve dry-run diagnostics. Verify the stale-case marker and retain full push refusal details. Actual complete preflight passes on this exact tree.\n\n* T-2800: regenerate provenance after the DEV branch update\n\nRebuild the canonical liberties source digest and source-use count after GitHub updated this integration. Only two generated metadata lines change; authored records, horse source, runtime, limits and workflow definitions stay as reviewed.\n\nThe owner authorized validating this DEV integration in fresh normal GitHub CI after local subprocess exhaustion. The earlier interrupted combined local gate remains a nonpass; DEV merge still requires green checks.","tree":{"sha":"43665a4b692d5283defba96f236aed14b3c02623","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/git/trees/43665a4b692d5283defba96f236aed14b3c02623"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/git/commits/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2672CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOwkQAKdUNsNY0sXy54Vlre7ntddo\nhLEUlOpdjgJ4EVquvkrFKqjs3Au2WY6tF8vGE4sHUHupY/IJXyLgGudWfS0HJ4iD\n/e8vhZaGycye9eo2wagsdilW+vI+lBjuzctRws4fwPd1VKBVdZLcDexESpXUXJKE\nx7GkEl5pGGr1By3IBz+fL+/2CSQToBEYjkv2A/fqwKLbk6Q9PlokVhWUO1sFV+/t\neVeQ5ExTPw98cenIY+u5hD8hRSkb7ESIcazF0k48kgr4VgHG0HHA7oPqUhgr3AoJ\nh6AWsFJeQWvq6D/MVVVYIBZtHlZz6/9hSismhXqO5tQ/3/tCPPQ/EB75Ruo9SBKQ\nwJD4ihbAt7B8DNhsc5/iSi+2PYLg7BbY7w2jaGFOjt7DBT1e4LYYAJe1KFtlRUkK\nF5IQGOYQ8IwHqA0w6gUXZazgbFhTRqOSe2rkY4eInmfqPny9i1ePIuy+TYoM6Qp1\ni6AuH1IyCSw1ZYGciv4mRk8yL7qY1DjUrav2JviNYAUPpxE//LOcEEEbal1FOkLb\nxUNt9u0zdFcFH4EF0EIYJfmrZkwY8OM417S+dQMXmlZWi5Moe2c6RxFNvKXGiI73\nujqiRYQfEfrfUFwGlIrzAHpk6luvjgy+IBoLjN8fwuyNsYIc4/UGXd8MsPcAhNbg\nP7EQi79FDj/m9C3Xmo0E\n=Et2E\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 43665a4b692d5283defba96f236aed14b3c02623\nparent eb1a0d11a96767a715a136ee43d94097ddf5b9cd\nauthor Kevin Haas <kevinroberthaas@gmail.com> 1792782070 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792782070 +0000\n\nT-2800, T-2803: add a planted standing horse to the Western Hotel yard (#1244)\n\n* T-2800: add a planted standing horse to the Western Hotel yard\n\nAdd the licensed canonical-metre horse and reconstructed 26-joint planted body shift, actual drawn-yard support, selection/card and owned material/mixer lifetime. Preserve existing people, vehicles and UI. Keep photographic, walking, harness, occupied and riding acceptance open.\n\nExclude unrelated recovery archives from the existing ticket-mirror fixture, retaining all ticket inputs and original mirror assertions; clean up a failed initial copy. Isolate default-CPU fixtures from caller limits and take the real mid-lap lock in the rebuild process, with an independent live-marker assertion. Emit fixture API states in Bash and preserve dry-run diagnostics. Verify the stale-case marker and retain full push refusal details. Actual complete preflight passes on this exact tree.\n\n* T-2800: regenerate provenance after the DEV branch update\n\nRebuild the canonical liberties source digest and source-use count after GitHub updated this integration. Only two generated metadata lines change; authored records, horse source, runtime, limits and workflow definitions stay as reviewed.\n\nThe owner authorized validating this DEV integration in fresh normal GitHub CI after local subprocess exhaustion. The earlier interrupted combined local gate remains a nonpass; DEV merge still requires green checks.","verified_at":"2026-10-23T19:01:10Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/commits/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/commit/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/commits/fa115d72534e234fe5ac7b94fd2f1a3eb38065c8/comments","author":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url"